  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026年最新】伊香保温泉おすすめ旅館10選！365段石段街＆黄金の湯・白銀の湯ガイド</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">万葉の昔から愛される名湯「伊香保温泉」。情緒あふれる「365段の石段街」。茶褐色の名湯「黄金の湯」と透き通る美肌の「白銀の湯」。そして日本三大うどん「水沢うどん」。</p>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">伊香保温泉の立地を整理し、<strong>「石段街直結・二大名湯完備・上州牛会席」で絶対に失敗しない厳選10選</strong>の魅力と見どころをご紹介します。！</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🗺️ 伊香保温泉エリアの距離感マップ</h2>\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 bg-stone-900 text-amber-300 font-mono text-xs rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto shadow-inner leading-relaxed\"><pre>【石段街最上段・伊香保神社・河鹿橋】（福一・岸権旅館）\n      │\n      │ 365段の石段（徒歩約10分）\n      ▼\n【石段街入口・中心部】（お宿玉樹・美松館・射的場・足湯）\n      │\n      │ 車・送迎で約3分\n      ▼\n【伊香保高台・パノラマビュー】（ホテル木暮・ホテル天坊・晴観荘）</pre></div>\n<li class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 ml-4 list-disc my-1\"><strong>渋川駅 ⇔ 伊香保温泉</strong>: 路線バスで約25分</li>\n<li class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 ml-4 list-disc my-1\"><strong>伊香保温泉 ⇔ 榛名湖</strong>: 車で約20分</li>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 伊香保温泉：後悔回避の厳選10選</h2>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">1. 伊香保温泉 ホテル木暮（伊香保高台）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.74</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/6266/6266.jpg\" alt=\"伊香保温泉　ホテル木暮 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜創業400余年！黄金の湯総湧出量の4分の1強を誇る北関東最大級の湯殿〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">ファミリー、三世代、ご夫婦、温泉巡り。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「伊香保温泉で圧倒的な湯量とお風呂のスケールを満喫するなら迷わずここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F6266%2F6266.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】伊香保温泉　ホテル木暮 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">2. 伊香保温泉 福一（石段街最上段）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-10